<title>USA: Infodata names Dettmar CFO.</title>
<headline>Infodata names Dettmar CFO.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFAX, Va. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Infodata Systems Inc said Tuesday it named Christopher Dettmar chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Infodata said Dettmar served previously as vice president, treasurer and CFO of Encompass Inc and TWS Inc.</p>
<p>The company did not say whom, if anyone, Dettmar replaced. A spokesman was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
